    *   MTP (Multi-Token Prediction) draft heads.
1.06.108.283 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    852, tg =  22.44 t/s, tg_3s =  23.82 t/s
    *   WS4 hyperconn prefill fusions.

#### 4. Stability & Correctness
*   **Greedy Purity:** Ensures plain decode matches `draft-mtp` verify for specific configurations.
*   **Bit-Identical Results:** CPU and GPU decode/verify batches are bit-identical (with1.09.133.069 I slot print_timing: id  0 | task 0 | n_gen =    921, tg =  22.46 t/s, tg_3s =  22.81 t/s
